      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VIENNA BELLE (8) showed good early speed and led throughout to score her maiden two back then finished fifth last start and beaten 2.5 lengths at this track over 300m (16.90). Returns to the course where she won her maiden. Better than last run and makes appeal this time. NEVER GIVING UP (1) has found the minor placings here at last couple of runs, finishing third last time beaten 0.6 lengths (16.88). Can measure up. SIMULTANEOUSLY (2) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 4.5 lengths from the winner (17.11). Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Should be about the money. KATY WANTED (4) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
